WEBVTT

00:00:10.524 --> 00:00:11.569
One.

00:00:11.569 --> 00:00:13.440
Two.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.963
Three.

00:00:14.963 --> 00:00:17.575
Expelliarmus!

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:26.975
Do you think he's all right?

00:00:26.975 --> 00:00:28.586
Who cares?

00:00:28.586 --> 00:00:30.283
An excellent idea
to show them that,

00:00:30.283 --> 00:00:31.676
Professor Snape,

00:00:31.676 --> 00:00:33.678
but if you don't mind
me saying,

00:00:33.678 --> 00:00:35.941
it was pretty obvious
what you were about to do.

00:00:35.941 --> 00:00:37.551
And if I had wanted to stop you,

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:39.031
it would have been
only too easy.

00:00:39.031 --> 00:00:40.772
Perhaps
it would be prudent

00:00:40.772 --> 00:00:45.516
to first teach the students
to block unfriendly spells,

00:00:45.516 --> 00:00:48.170
professor.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:52.305
An excellent suggestion,
Professor Snape.

00:00:52.305 --> 00:00:56.004
Well...
Let's have a volunteer pair.

00:00:56.004 --> 00:00:57.832
Potter, Weasley, how about you?

00:00:57.832 --> 00:01:00.052
Weasley's wand
causes devastation

00:01:00.052 --> 00:01:01.532
with the simplest spells.

00:01:01.532 --> 00:01:04.012
We'll be sending Potter
to the hospital wing

00:01:04.012 --> 00:01:05.100
in a matchbox.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.363
Might I suggest

00:01:06.363 --> 00:01:08.365
someone from my own house?

00:01:11.368 --> 00:01:13.370
Malfoy, perhaps?

00:01:14.893 --> 00:01:17.591
[♪♪♪]

00:01:21.029 --> 00:01:22.335
Good luck, Potter.

00:01:22.335 --> 00:01:24.381
Thank you, sir.

00:01:31.388 --> 00:01:32.389
LOCKHART: Wands at the ready.

00:01:33.999 --> 00:01:35.479
Scared, Potter?

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:37.176
You wish.

00:01:47.099 --> 00:01:49.362
On the count
of three,

00:01:49.362 --> 00:01:52.104
cast your charms to
disarm your opponent,

00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:53.845
onlyto disarm.

00:01:53.845 --> 00:01:56.195
We don't want
any accidents here.

00:01:56.195 --> 00:01:57.501
One.

00:01:58.763 --> 00:02:00.068
Two.

00:02:00.068 --> 00:02:01.853
Everte Statum!

00:02:13.386 --> 00:02:14.909
Rictusempra!

00:02:18.217 --> 00:02:19.436
[CROWD LAUGHS]

00:02:26.878 --> 00:02:28.532
I said disarm only.

00:02:28.532 --> 00:02:29.663
Serpensortia!

00:02:39.107 --> 00:02:42.241
Don't move, Potter.
I'll get rid of it for you.

00:02:42.241 --> 00:02:44.417
Allow me,
Professor Snape.

00:02:44.417 --> 00:02:47.812
Alarte Ascendare!

00:03:01.303 --> 00:03:05.003
[SPEAKING IN PARSELTONGUE]

